  partName: Right Outer Cover Duplicate
  description: The Right Outer Cover Duplicate is an identical, large, elongated
    component positioned at the middle-right-center of the jet engine, fabricated
    from Outer cover 1 material. Its primary function is to provide redundant protection
    and support to the engine's internal mechanisms, ensuring continued operation
    in the event of a failure. Notably, its duplicate design enables easier maintenance
    and replacement procedures.
